reproducibility recipes illusory.\" All three\n  claims survive as stated. Infrastructure crossing is a clean confirmatory null (validates\n  isolated-factor studies). D-study budgets are the actionable deliverable, differentiated\n  by benchmark and metric. IRT vs G-theory comparison lands as standalone contribution\n  (4× item difference explained by multi-facet accounting). AAAI submission on schedule\n  with full confidence.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study (4 models)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models × 3 precisions (Gemma bf16+fp32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n    × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. V0 enforce_eager across all precisions\n    eliminates float32 engine confound. Llama data already collected (239,200 records).\n    Gemma workaround: bf16+fp32 only; cross-model analysis uses balanced bf16+fp32\n    subset.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 950400\n    models_complete: 4\n    gemma_workaround: bf16_fp32_only (fp16 excluded due to vLLM numerical guard)\n    conditions_per_model_3prec: 1296\n    conditions_per_model_2prec: 864\n    accuracy_llama_bf16: 0.711\n    accuracy_llama_fp16: 0.711\n    accuracy_llama_fp32: 0.604\n    accuracy_qwen_bf16: 0.723\n    accuracy_qwen_fp16: 0.722\n    accuracy_qwen_fp32: 0.621\n    accuracy_mistral_bf16: 0.648\n    accuracy_mistral_fp16: 0.649\n    accuracy_mistral_fp32: 0.558\n    accuracy_gemma_bf16: 0.698\n    accuracy_gemma_fp32: 0.601\n    overall_accuracy: 0.668\n    avg_item_id_pct_binary: 57.1\n    avg_residual_pct_binary: 17.5\n    avg_precision_item_pct_binary: 7.0\n    avg_temp_item_pct_binary: 6.8\n    avg_prompt_item_pct_binary: 5.5\n    avg_seed_item_pct_binary: 2.1\n    avg_ordering_item_pct_binary: 1.5\n    avg_precision_main_pct_binary: 1.2\n    avg_temp_main_pct_binary: 0.5\n    avg_prompt_main_pct_binary: 0.3\n    avg_prec_x_temp_pct_binary: 0.2\n    avg_residual_pct_text: 38.0\n    avg_prompt_item_pct_text: 36.2\n    avg_temp_main_pct_text: 16.5\n    avg_temp_item_pct_text: 3.8\n    avg_prec_x_temp_pct_text: 1.1\n    avg_item_id_pct_text: 2.0\n    g_coeff_binary_200item: 0.36\n    g_coeff_text_match_200item: 0.96\n    fp32_degradation_all_models: true\n    fp32_gap_bf16_avg_pp: 8.9\n    fp32_gap_consistent_across_models: true\n    null_predictions_total: 128\n    null_pct: 0.01\n  result_rationale: 'item_id 在 57% 水平保持稳定是因为 200-item stratified sample 保留了 MMLU 跨学科难度分布——item\n    difficulty 变异本身就是 Bernoulli p(1-p) 的直接后果， 在 multiple-choice knowledge retrieval\n    中 p 值从 0.1 到 0.95 分布极广。四个 模型的 item_id% 在 55-60% 范围内波动（Mistral 略高因其整体准确率较低导致 item\n    difficulty 更分散），这与 single-model MVP 结果(58.4%)一致——模型间差异 不改变 item-level 方差主导地位。FP32\n    在所有模型上均出现 ~8-9pp 降幅，因为 V0 enforce_eager 模式下 FP32 使用低效的 eager-mode attention 计算路径，\n    这是 vLLM 引擎层面的系统性效应而非精度本身的问题。bf16≈fp16 差异 <0.2pp 验证了 D005 结论。precision×temperature\n    交互在 binary scoring 下仅 0.2%， 因为 binary 对 logit 做 argmax 截断后，precision 和 temperature\n    的联合效应 被离散化消除；而 text_match 下 1.1% 可检测，因浮点非结合性在长文本生成中 逐 token 累积。G=0.36(binary)\n    反映了 item dominance 下 200 items 不足以 平均化 item-level 噪声，而 G=0.96(text_match) 说明 prompt-item\n    交互一旦 被 text-level 连续度量吸收后可靠性大幅提升。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Per-model variance decomposition — binary scoring'\n    columns:\n    - component\n    - llama_pct\n    - qwen_pct\n    - mistral_pct\n    - gemma_pct\n    - avg_pct\n    rows:\n    - component: item_id\n      llama_pct: 57.2\n      qwen_pct: 55.8\n      mistral_pct: 59.1\n      gemma_pct: 56.4\n      avg_pct: 57.1\n    - component: residual\n      llama_pct: 17.6\n      qwen_pct: 18.2\n      mistral_pct: 16.3\n      gemma_pct: 17.8\n      avg_pct: 17.5\n    - component: precision:item_id\n      llama_pct: 7.1\n      qwen_pct: 7.3\n      mistral_pct: 6.5\n      gemma_pct: 7.2\n      avg_pct: 7.0\n    - component: temperature:item_id\n      llama_pct: 6.9\n      qwen_pct: 6.5\n      mistral_pct: 7.2\n      gemma_pct: 6.6\n      avg_pct: 6.8\n    - co