t_match reveals infrastructure×methodology interactions ← 基于 mvp_phase_a\\\\n- **exp001_pilot** (success): exp-001 pipeline (4-GPU sharding, model_path mapping, offset-based splitting, 200 items) produces correct and complete JSONL output with all 15 fields, suitable for downstream G-theory analysis code development\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 3 / 负向 1 / 失败 1 / 共 5\\\\noverall_accuracy: 0.6814 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\ntotal_records: 239200 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp001_gemma: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2053, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01139V1TFyXMbhEn8xDmZP2o","session_id":"db6a3d8a-492b-4ec1-b68e-c01acc7fc375","uuid":"bccc61c3-ed4e-40c8-8475-ae5d13f0cfa1","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:25:18.428Z"}
