{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GVMEe5Jw1PVnMrJDuPY5zr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Original framing holds intact. Headline: \"Variance structure\n2\t  is benchmark-conditional — item dominance on knowledge retrieval, interaction dominance\n3\t  on reasoning — rendering universal reproducibility recipes illusory.\" All three\n4\t  claims survive as stated. Infrastructure crossing is a clean confirmatory null (validates\n5\t  isolated-factor studies). D-study budgets are the actionable deliverable, differentiated\n6\t  by benchmark and metric. IRT vs G-theory comparison lands as standalone contribution\n7\t  (4× item difference explained by multi-facet accounting). AAAI submission on schedule\n8\t  with full confidence.\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study (4 models)\n13\t  plan_id: exp-001\n14\t  description: '4 models × 3 precisions (Gemma bf16+fp32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n15\t    × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. V0 enforce_eager across all precisions\n16\t    eliminates float32 engine confound. Llama data already collected (239,200 records).\n17\t    Gemma workaround: bf16+fp32 only; cross-model analysis uses balanced bf16+fp32\n18\t    subset.\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    total_records: 950400\n23\t    models_complete: 4\n24\t    gemma_workaround: bf16_fp32_only (fp16 excluded due to vLLM numerical guard)\n25\t    conditions_per_model_3prec: 1296\n26\t    conditions_per_model_2prec: 864\n27\t    accuracy_llama_bf16: 0.711\n28\t    accuracy_llama_fp16: 0.711\n29\t    accuracy_llama_fp32: 0.604\n30\t    accuracy_qwen_bf16: 0.723\n31\t    accuracy_qwen_fp16: 0.722\n32\t    accuracy_qwen_fp32: 0.621\n33\t    accuracy_mistral_bf16: 0.648\n34\t    accuracy_mistral_fp16: 0.649\n35\t    accuracy_mistral_fp32: 0.558\n36\t    accuracy_gemma_bf16: 0.698\n37\t    accuracy_gemma_fp32: 0.601\n38\t    overall_accuracy: 0.668\n39\t    avg_item_id_pct_binary: 57.1\n40\t    avg_residual_pct_binary: 17.5\n41\t    avg_precision_item_pct_binary: 7.0\n42\t    avg_temp_item_pct_binary: 6.8\n43\t    avg_prompt_item_pct_binary: 5.5\n44\t    avg_seed_item_pct_binary: 2.1\n45\t    avg_ordering_item_pct_binary: 1.5\n46\t    avg_precision_main_pct_binary: 1.2\n47\t    avg_temp_main_pct_binary: 0.5\n48\t    avg_prompt_main_pct_binary: 0.3\n49\t    avg_prec_x_temp_pct_binary: 0.2\n50\t    avg_residual_pct_text: 38.0\n51\t    avg_prompt_item_pct_text: 36.2\n52\t    avg_temp_main_pct_text: 16.5\n53\t    avg_temp_item_pct_text: 3.8\n54\t    avg_prec_x_temp_pct_text: 1.1\n55\t    avg_item_id_pct_text: 2.0\n56\t    g_coeff_binary_200item: 0.36\n57\t    g_coeff_text_match_200item: 0.96\n58\t    fp32_degradation_all_models: true\n59\t    fp32_gap_bf16_avg_pp: 8.9\n60\t    fp32_gap_consistent_across_models: true\n61\t    null_predictions_total: 128\n62\t    null_pct: 0.01\n63\t  result_rationale: 'item_id 在 57% 水平保持稳定是因为 200-item stratified sample 保留了 MMLU 跨学科难度分布——item\n64\t    difficulty 变异本身就是 Bernoulli p(1-p) 的直接后果， 在 multiple-choice knowledge retrieval\n65\t    中 p 值从 0.1 到 0.95 分布极广。四个 模型的 item_id% 在 55-60% 范围内波动（Mistral 略高因其整体准确率较低导致 item\n66\t    difficulty 更分散），这与 single-model MVP 结果(58.4%)一致——模型间差异 不改变 item-level 方差主导地位。FP32\n67\t    在所有模型上均出现 ~8-9pp 降幅，因为 V0 enforce_eager 模式下 FP32 使用低效的 eager-mode attention 计算路径，\n68\t    这是 vLLM 引擎层面的系统性效应而非精度本身的问题。bf16≈fp16 差异 <0.2pp 验证了 D005 结论。precision×temperature\n69\t    交互在 binary scoring 下仅 0.2%， 因为 binary 对 logit 做 argmax 截断后，precision 和 temperature\n70\t    的联合效应 被离散化消除；而 text_match 下 1.1% 可检测，因浮点非结合性在长文本生成中 逐 token 累积。G=0.36(binary)\n71\t    反映了 item dominance 下 200 items 不足以 平均化 item-level 噪声，而 G=0.96(text_match) 说明 prompt-item\n72\t    交互一旦 被 text-level 连续度量吸收后可靠性大幅提升。\n73\t\n74\t    '\n75\t  tables:\n76\t  - name: 'Table 1: Per-model variance decomposition — binary scoring'\n77\t    columns:\n78\t    - component\n79\t    - llama_pct\n80\t    - qwen_pct\n81\t    - mistral_pct\n82\t    - gemma_pct\n83\t    - avg_pct\n84\t    rows:\n85\t    - component: item_id\n86\t      llama_pct: 57.2\n87\t      qwen_pct: 55.8\n88\t      mistral_pct: 59.1\n89\t      gemma_pct: 56.4\n90\t      avg_pct: 57.1\n91\t    - component: residual\n92\t      llama_pct: 17.6\n93\t      qwen_pct: 18.2\n94\t      mistral_pct: 16.3\n95\t      gemma_pct: 17.8\n96\t      avg_pct: 17.5\n97\t    - component: precision:item_id\n98\t      llama_pct: 7.1\n99\t      qwen_pct: 7.3\n100\t      mistral_pct: 6.5\n101\t      gemma_pct: 7.2\n102\t      avg_pct: 7.0\n103\t    - component: temperature:item_id\n104\t      llama_pct: 6.9\n105\t      qwen_pct: 6.5\n106\t      mistral_pct: 7.2\n107\t      gemma_pct: 6.6\n108\t      avg_pct: 6.8\n109\t    - component: prompt:item_id\n110\t      llama_pct: 5.4\n111\t      qwen_pct: 5.8\n112\t      mistral_pct: 5.2\n113\t      gemma_pct: 5.6\n114\t      avg_pct: 5.5\n115\t    - component: seed:item_id\n116\t      llama_pct: 2.0\n117\t      qwen_pct: 2.3\n118\t      mistral_pct: 1.9\n119\t      gemma_pct: 2.1\n120\t      avg_pct: 2.1\n121\t    - component: ordering:item_id\n122\t      llama_pct: 1.5\n123\t      qwen_pct: 1.4\n124\t      mistral_pct: 1.6\n125\t      gemma_pct: 1.4\n126\t      avg_pct: 1.5\n127\t    - component: precision\n128\t      llama_pct: 1.1\n129\t      qwen_pct: 1.3\n130\t      mistral_pct: 1.2\n131\t      gemma_pct: 1.1\n132\t      avg_pct: 1.2\n133\t    - component: temperature\n134\t      llama_pct: 0.5\n135\t      qwen_pct: 0.4\n136\t      mistral_pct: 0.5\n137\t      gemma_pct: 0.6\n138\t      avg_pct: 0.5\n139\t    - component: prompt_template\n140\t      llama_pct: 0.3\n141\t      qwen_pct: 0.4\n142\t      mistral_pct: 0.2\n143\t      gemma_pct: 0.3\n144\t      avg_pct: 0.3\n145\t    - component: precision:temperature\n146\t      llama_pct: 0.2\n147\t      qwen_pct: 0.3\n148\t      mistral_pct: 0.1\n149\t      gemma_pct: 0.2\n150\t      avg_pct: 0.2\n151\t    - component: other_interactions\n152\t      llama_pct: 0.2\n153\t      qwen_pct: 0.3\n154\t      mistral_pct: 0.2\n155\t      gemma_pct: 0.7\n156\t      avg_pct: 0.3\n157\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-model variance decomposition — text_exact_match'\n158\t    columns:\n159\t    - component\n160\t    - llama_pct\n161\t    - qwen_pct\n162\t    - mistral_pct\n163\t    - gemma_pct\n164\t    - avg_pct\n165\t    rows:\n166\t    - component: residual\n167\t      llama_pct: 38.5\n168\t      qwen_pct: 37.2\n169\t      mistral_pct: 39.1\n170\t      gemma_pct: 37.3\n171\t      avg_pct: 38.0\n172\t    - component: prompt:item_id\n173\t      llama_pct: 35.8\n174\t      qwen_pct: 37.0\n175\t      mistral_pct: 35.5\n176\t      gemma_pct: 36.4\n177\t      avg_pct: 36.2\n178\t    - component: temperature\n179\t      llama_pct: 16.8\n180\t      qwen_pct: 16.0\n181\t      mistral_pct: 16.5\n182\t      gemma_pct: 16.7\n183\t      avg_pct: 16.5\n184\t    - component: temperature:item_id\n185\t      llama_pct: 3.5\n186\t      qwen_pct: 4.2\n187\t      mistral_pct: 3.6\n188\t      gemma_pct: 3.8\n189\t      avg_pct: 3.8\n190\t    - component: precision:temperature\n191\t      llama_pct: 1.2\n192\t      qwen_pct: 1.0\n193\t      mistral_pct: 1.1\n194\t      gemma_pct: 1.0\n195\t      avg_pct: 1.1\n196\t    - component: item_id\n197\t      llama_pct: 1.8\n198\t      qwen_pct: 2.3\n199\t      mistral_pct: 1.9\n200\t      gemma_pct: 2.1\n201\t      avg_pct: 2.0\n202\t    - component: precision:item_id\n203\t      llama_pct: 1.2\n204\t      qwen_pct: 1.1\n205\t      mistral_pct: 1.3\n206\t      gemma_pct: 1.2\n207\t      avg_pct: 1.2\n208\t    - component: other\n209\t      llama_pct: 1.2\n210\t      qwen_pct: 1.2\n211\t      mistral_pct: 1.0\n212\t      gemma_pct: 1.5\n213\t      avg_pct: 1.2\n214\t  - name: 'Table 3: Accuracy by model × precision × temperature'\n215\t    columns:\n216\t    - model\n217\t    - precision\n218\t    - T0.0\n219\t    - T0.3\n220\t    - T0.7\n221\t    rows:\n222\t    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n223\t      precision: bf16\n224\t      T0.0: 0.729\n225\t      T0.3: 0.709\n226\t      T0.7: 0.695\n227\t    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n228\t      precision: fp16\n229\t      T0.0: 0.73\n230\t      T0.3: 0.709\n231\t      T0.7: 0.695\n232\t    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n233\t      precision: fp32\n234\t      T0.0: 0.625\n235\t      T0.3: 0.601\n236\t      T0.7: 0.587\n237\t    - model: Qwen3-8B\n238\t      precision: bf16\n239\t      T0.0: 0.742\n240\t      T0.3: 0.721\n241\t      T0.7: 0.706\n242\t    - model: Qwen3-8B\n243\t      precision: fp16\n244\t      T0.0: 0.741\n245\t      T0.3: 0.72\n246\t      T0.7: 0.705\n247\t    - model: Qwen3-8B\n248\t      precision: fp32\n249\t      T0.0: 0.643\n250\t      T0.3: 0.618\n251\t      T0.7: 0.602\n252\t    - model: Mistral-7B\n253\t      precision: bf16\n254\t      T0.0: 0.668\n255\t      T0.3: 0.645\n256\t      T0.7: 0.631\n257\t    - model: Mistral-7B\n258\t      precision: fp16\n259\t      T0.0: 0.669\n260\t      T0.3: 0.646\n261\t      T0.7: 0.632\n262\t    - model: Mistral-7B\n263\t      precision: fp32\n264\t      T0.0: 0.578\n265\t      T0.3: 0.555\n266\t      T0.7: 0.541\n267\t    - model: Gemma-2-9B\n268\t      precision: bf16\n269\t      T0.0: 0.718\n270\t      T0.3: 0.696\n271\t      T0.7: 0.681\n272\t    - model: Gemma-2-9B\n273\t      precision: fp32\n274\t      T0.0: 0.622\n275\t      T0.3: 0.598\n276\t      T0.7: 0.583\n277\t  figures_description:\n278\t  - 'Fig E1-1: 4-panel stacked bar — per-model variance decomposition (binary). 四个模型呈现几乎同构的方差结构，item_id\n279\t    在 55-59% 区间以深蓝色主导，precision:item 和 temp:item 交互以中间色调紧随。视觉上立刻传达 item dominance\n280\t    的跨模型稳健性。'\n281\t  - 'Fig E1-2: 双指标对比 — binary vs text_match 方差结构（grouped bar per component）。binary\n282\t    下 item_id=57% 主导 vs text_match 下 prompt:item=36% 主导，直观展示指标选择如何根本性地改变方差结论。'\n283\t  - 'Fig E1-3: Heatmap — model × precision × temperature 准确率。FP32 行在所有模型上均呈现明显冷色调（低准确率），bf16/fp16\n284\t    行近乎相同，温度升高伴随轻微降幅。'\n285\t  - 'Fig E1-4: FP32 degradation pattern — 每个模型的 bf16-fp32 差值（error bar 跨 prompt/seed/ordering），所有模型均落在\n286\t    7.5-10pp 区间，确认这是系统性引擎效应。'\n287\t  analysis: 'exp-001 在四个模型上复现并巩固了 MVP 的 item dominance 发现。关键观察： (1) item_id 在 55-59%\n288\t    的窄区间内波动，模型间标准差仅 1.4pp——这不是单一模型的 偶然特性，而是 MMLU item difficulty 分布的固有统计结构；(2) FP32\n289\t    降幅在所有模型上 均为 8-9pp，确认 V0 enforce_eager 修复后这是一致的引擎级效应，而非 precision 本身； (3) binary\n290\t    与 text_match 呈现完全不同的方差层级——这为 Claim 3 (metric-conditional budget) 提供了最直接的证据来源；(4)\n291\t    所有 precision×method 直接交互在 binary 下 ≤0.3%，在 text_match 下 ≤1.2%，为 Claim 2 separability\n292\t    提供了 MMLU 上的强支撑。 Gemma bf16+fp32 workaround 成功，cross-model balanced analysis 使用\n293\t    bf16+fp32 子集。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t- name: Item resampling stability test\n297\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n298\t  description: '3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (seeds 0/7/99) × Llama-3.1-8B\n299\t    × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions per sample.\n300\t    Tests whether headline item_id% finding is artifact of specific item draw.\n301\t\n302\t    '\n303\t  expected_results:\n304\t    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n305\t    total_records: 32400\n306\t    sample_0_item_id_pct: 57.5\n307\t    sample_7_item_id_pct: 55.8\n308\t    sample_99_item_id_pct: 58.6\n309\t    item_id_mean_across_samples: 57.3\n310\t    item_id_sd_across_samples: 1.4\n311\t    item_id_range_pp: 2.8\n312\t    residual_range_pp: 1.8\n313\t    precision_item_range_pp: 1.2\n314\t    temp_item_range_pp: 1.5\n315\t    pairwise_item_overlap_pct: 0\n316\t    stratification_match: 14 MMLU subjects represented in all 3 samples\n317\t    g_binary_sample_0: 0.35\n318\t    g_binary_sample_7: 0.37\n319\t    g_binary_sample_99: 0.34\n320\t    g_binary_range: 0.03\n321\t  result_rationale: '三次独立 stratified sampling 从 MMLU 的 ~14K items 中抽取 200 items，每次样本\n322\t    完全不同（0 overlap），但由于分层抽样保证了学科分布一致性，item difficulty 的总体 分布在每个样本中都近似复现了 full MMLU\n323\t    的难度谱。item_id% 在 55.8-58.6% 范围内 波动（SD=1.4pp）是 expected 的抽样方差——200 items 的 bootstrap\n324\t    SE 约为 1.5pp （后续 exp-004 会精确量化）。若方差分解对特定 item 选择敏感（例如某些 \"adversarial\" items 驱动结果），我们会看到\n325\t    >5pp 的波动；2.8pp 的 range 落在统计噪声范围内， 确认 item dominance 是 MMLU 难度分布的总体特性而非样本偶然。G-coefficient\n326\t    同样稳定 （range=0.03），进一步验证 D-study 推断的可靠基础。\n327\t\n328\t    '\n329\t  tables:\n330\t  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-sample variance decomposition stability'\n331\t    columns:\n332\t    - component\n333\t    - sample_0\n334\t    - sample_7\n335\t    - sample_99\n336\t    - mean\n337\t    - sd\n338\t    rows:\n339\t    - component: item_id\n340\t      sample_0: 57.5\n341\t      sample_7: 55.8\n342\t      sample_99: 58.6\n343\t      mean: 57.3\n344\t      sd: 1.4\n345\t    - component: residual\n346\t      sample_0: 17.2\n347\t      sample_7: 18.5\n348\t      sample_99: 16.8\n349\t      mean: 17.5\n350\t      sd: 0.9\n351\t    - component: precision:item_id\n352\t      sample_0: 7.1\n353\t      sample_7: 7.5\n354\t      sample_99: 6.5\n355\t      mean: 7.0\n356\t      sd: 0.5\n357\t    - component: temperature:item_id\n358\t      sample_0: 6.5\n359\t      sample_7: 7.2\n360\t      sample_99: 6.8\n361\t      mean: 6.8\n362\t      sd: 0.4\n363\t    - component: prompt:item_id\n364\t      sample_0: 5.8\n365\t      sample_7: 5.0\n366\t      sample_99: 5.6\n367\t      mean: 5.5\n368\t      sd: 0.4\n369\t    - component: seed:item_id\n370\t      sample_0: 2.2\n371\t      sample_7: 1.8\n372\t      sample_99: 2.1\n373\t      mean: 2.0\n374\t      sd: 0.2\n375\t    - component: ordering:item_id\n376\t      sample_0: 1.4\n377\t      sample_7: 1.7\n378\t      sample_99: 1.3\n379\t      mean: 1.5\n380\t      sd: 0.2\n381\t    - component: precision\n382\t      sample_0: 1.2\n383\t      sample_7: 1.1\n384\t      sample_99: 1.3\n385\t      mean: 1.2\n386\t      sd: 0.1\n387\t    - component: other\n388\t      sample_0: 1.1\n389\t      sample_7: 1.4\n390\t      sample_99: 1.0\n391\t      mean: 1.2\n392\t      sd: 0.2\n393\t  figures_description:\n394\t  - 'Fig E1b-1: Forest plot — item_id% 点估计及 95% CI 跨三个样本，加一条均值参考线。三个 CI 大幅重叠，视觉上传达稳定性。'\n395\t  - 'Fig E1b-2: 三样本方差分解 stacked bar 并排对比，色块比例几乎相同。'\n396\t  analysis: 'Stability test 是对 headline claim 的关键防御。2.8pp range 远小于 \"item_id >40%\"\n397\t    threshold 的裕度（即使最低样本的 55.8% 也远超 40%）。这允许论文自信声称 item dominance 是 MMLU 的结构性属性。该结果也校准了\n398\t    bootstrap CI 的预期宽度——exp-004 的 1000-resample bootstrap 应产生 ~3-4pp 的 95% CI，与这里观察到的\n399\t    cross-sample 变异一致。\n400\t\n401\t    '\n402\t- name: Multi-benchmark replication (GSM8K, ARC, HellaSwag)\n403\t  plan_id: exp-002\n404\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16; Gemma bf16 only) × 6 prompts ×\n405\t    6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0, T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items per benchmark.\n406\t    Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs exp-001''s 3×3) due to GPU budget. Tests cross-benchmark\n407\t    variance gradient — the primary novel finding.\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t  expected_results:\n411\t    total_records_gsm8k: 403200\n412\t    total_records_arc: 403200\n413\t    total_records_hellaswag: 403200\n414\t    total_records_all: 1209600\n415\t    benchmarks_complete: 3\n416\t    models_with_data_per_benchmark: 4\n417\t    acc_gsm8k_llama: 0.518\n418\t    acc_gsm8k_qwen: 0.612\n419\t    acc_gsm8k_mistral: 0.385\n420\t    acc_gsm8k_gemma: 0.492\n421\t    acc_arc_llama: 0.782\n422\t    acc_arc_qwen: 0.815\n423\t    acc_arc_mistral: 0.738\n424\t    acc_arc_gemma: 0.795\n425\t    acc_hellaswag_llama: 0.762\n426\t    acc_hellaswag_qwen: 0.788\n427\t    acc_hellaswag_mistral: 0.721\n428\t    acc_hellaswag_gemma: 0.755\n429\t    gsm8k_item_id_pct: 22.4\n430\t    gsm8k_temp_item_pct: 18.5\n431\t    gsm8k_residual_pct: 24.8\n432\t    gsm8k_seed_item_pct: 12.3\n433\t    gsm8k_prompt_item_pct: 10.2\n434\t    gsm8k_temp_main_pct: 4.5\n435\t    gsm8k_prec_item_pct: 3.2\n436\t    gsm8k_ordering_item_pct: 2.1\n437\t    gsm8k_prec_main_pct: 0.8\n438\t    gsm8k_prec_x_temp_binary: 0.6\n439\t    gsm8k_other_pct: 0.6\n440\t    arc_item_id_pct: 43.7\n441\t    arc_residual_pct: 20.3\n442\t    arc_temp_item_pct: 9.8\n443\t    arc_prompt_item_pct: 8.5\n444\t    arc_prec_item_pct: 6.2\n445\t    arc_seed_item_pct: 4.5\n446\t    arc_ordering_item_pct: 2.8\n447\t    arc_temp_main_pct: 1.5\n448\t    arc_prec_main_pct: 1.2\n449\t    arc_prec_x_temp_binary: 0.3\n450\t    arc_other_pct: 1.2\n451\t    hellaswag_item_id_pct: 38.2\n452\t    hellaswag_residual_pct: 22.5\n453\t    hellaswag_temp_item_pct: 12.3\n454\t    hellaswag_prompt_item_pct: 9.8\n455\t    hellaswag_seed_item_pct: 6.5\n456\t    hellaswag_prec_item_pct: 4.8\n457\t    hellaswag_ordering_item_pct: 2.4\n458\t    hellaswag_temp_main_pct: 1.5\n459\t    hellaswag_prec_main_pct: 0.8\n460\t    hellaswag_prec_x_temp_binary: 0.4\n461\t    hellaswag_other_pct: 0.8\n462\t    gradient_order: MMLU(57.1) > ARC(43.7) > HellaSwag(38.2) > GSM8K(22.4)\n463\t    gradient_total_pp: 34.7\n464\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n465\t    gradient_is_clean: true\n466\t    max_prec_x_method_binary_all_benchmarks: 0.6\n467\t    g_binary_gsm8k_200item: 0.48\n468\t    g_binary_arc_200item: 0.42\n469\t    g_binary_hellaswag_200item: 0.44\n470\t    gsm8k_text_prec_x_temp_pct: 2.5\n471\t    gsm8k_text_prompt_item_pct: 28.3\n472\t    gsm8k_text_residual_pct: 25.1\n473\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient 的物理机制：MMLU 是 knowledge retrieval，答案由模型权重中\n474\t    存储的事实决定——item difficulty（该事实是否被记忆）解释了大部分方差。ARC 是 science reasoning 但仍有大量事实检索成分，item_id\n475\t    降至 43.7%。HellaSwag 是 commonsense completion，需要更多 contextual inference，temperature\n476\t    和 seed 对生成路径的影响更大， item_id 降至 38.2%。GSM8K 是 multi-step arithmetic reasoning，每一步的\n477\t    token sampling 引入 compounding uncertainty——temperature×item 跃升至 18.5% 因为不同难度的\n478\t    题目对 sampling 随机性的敏感度差异巨大（简单的一步题几乎不受影响，复杂的五步题在每步都可能 偏离正确路径）。seed×item 12.3% 同理——CUDA\n479\t    级非确定性在 multi-step generation 中 逐步累积。residual 在 GSM8K 达 24.8% 反映了未建模的高阶交互（prompt×seed×item\n480\t    等）。 precision×temperature 在 binary 下始终 ≤0.6%——即使在 reasoning 任务上 aggregate-level\n481\t    separability 仍然成立，因为 precision 影响的是 logit 精度而 temperature 影响的是 sampling distribution，两者通过不同机制作用于输出。但在\n482\t    text_match 下 GSM8K 的 precision×temperature 达 2.5%，因为 reasoning chain 的文本表达对浮点累积误差更敏感。\n483\t    gradient 的单调性（57>44>38>22）不是拟合结果而是任务认知复杂度的直接映射。\n484\t\n485\t    '\n486\t  tables:\n487\t  - name: 'Table 5: Cross-benchmark variance decomposition — binary scoring (single-model\n488\t      averages)'\n489\t    columns:\n490\t    - component\n491\t    - MMLU\n492\t    - ARC\n493\t    - HellaSwag\n494\t    - GSM8K\n495\t    note: MMLU values from exp-001 included for comparison\n496\t    rows:\n497\t    - component: item_id\n498\t      MMLU: 57.1\n499\t      ARC: 43.7\n500\t      HellaSwag: 38.2"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01139V1TFyXMbhEn8xDmZP2o","session_id":"db6a3d8a-492b-4ec1-b68e-c01acc7fc375","uuid":"9c06ff6d-75f9-42cb-b962-fc0539ee1f9a","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:25:40.581Z"}
