e_reasoning\n569\t      item_id_pct: 43.7\n570\t      sum_method_x_item_pct: 31.8\n571\t      dominant_interaction: temp:item(9.8)\n572\t      g_binary_200: 0.42\n573\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n574\t      task_type: commonsense\n575\t      item_id_pct: 38.2\n576\t      sum_method_x_item_pct: 35.8\n577\t      dominant_interaction: temp:item(12.3)\n578\t      g_binary_200: 0.44\n579\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n580\t      task_type: math_reasoning\n581\t      item_id_pct: 22.4\n582\t      sum_method_x_item_pct: 46.3\n583\t      dominant_interaction: temp:item(18.5)\n584\t      g_binary_200: 0.48\n585\t  - name: 'Table 7: Separability test — direct infra×method interactions across benchmarks'\n586\t    columns:\n587\t    - benchmark\n588\t    - metric\n589\t    - prec_x_temp_pct\n590\t    - prec_x_prompt_pct\n591\t    - prec_x_seed_pct\n592\t    - prec_x_ordering_pct\n593\t    - max_direct\n594\t    rows:\n595\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n596\t      metric: binary\n597\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 0.2\n598\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.1\n599\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.0\n600\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.0\n601\t      max_direct: 0.2\n602\t    - benchmark: ARC\n603\t      metric: binary\n604\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 0.3\n605\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.1\n606\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.0\n607\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.0\n608\t      max_direct: 0.3\n609\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n610\t      metric: binary\n611\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 0.4\n612\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.1\n613\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.0\n614\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.1\n615\t      max_direct: 0.4\n616\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n617\t      metric: binary\n618\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 0.6\n619\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.2\n620\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.1\n621\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.0\n622\t      max_direct: 0.6\n623\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n624\t      metric: text_match\n625\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 1.1\n626\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.3\n627\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.1\n628\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.0\n629\t      max_direct: 1.1\n630\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n631\t      metric: text_match\n632\t      prec_x_temp_pct: 2.5\n633\t      prec_x_prompt_pct: 0.8\n634\t      prec_x_seed_pct: 0.3\n635\t      prec_x_ordering_pct: 0.1\n636\t      max_direct: 2.5\n637\t  figures_description:\n638\t  - 'Fig E2-1 [SIGNATURE FIGURE]: 4-benchmark stacked bar of variance decomposition\n639\t    (binary scoring). 从左到右 MMLU→ARC→HellaSwag→GSM8K，item_id (深蓝) 占比递减，method×item\n640\t    交互 (暖色调) 占比递增。这是论文的核心视觉——读者一眼看出 variance structure 是 benchmark-conditional 的。'\n641\t  - 'Fig E2-2: Gradient line plot — item_id% (y) vs benchmark (x, ordered by cognitive\n642\t    complexity). 线性下降趋势，附 R²。四个模型各一条线，趋势方向一致但斜率略有差异。'\n643\t  - 'Fig E2-3: Interaction buildup — temp×item 和 seed×item 占比从 MMLU 到 GSM8K 的增长曲线。两条线同步上升，说明\n644\t    sampling randomness 在 reasoning 任务中系统性放大。'\n645\t  - 'Fig E2-4: Separability confirmation — direct infra×method 交互热力图（benchmark × interaction\n646\t    term），所有单元格 <0.8% (binary)，颜色几乎一致。'\n647\t  analysis: 'exp-002 是论文的核心贡献实验。单调 gradient 的存在从根本上解释了文献中的矛盾发现—— Brittlebench 在 MMLU-类任务上发现\n648\t    prompt 主导方差，而其他研究在 reasoning 任务上 发现 seed/temperature 更重要——两者都是对的，只是在不同 benchmark\n649\t    regime 中观察。 Claim 1 因此被精确化为 \"benchmark-conditional item dominance\"。Claim 2 在所有\n650\t    benchmark 上成立（max direct infra×method = 0.6% binary），但 text_match 上的 benchmark-conditional\n651\t    separability 破裂（GSM8K text_match 达 2.5%）进一步支撑了 Claim 3 的 metric-conditional 论点。G-coefficient\n652\t    反直觉地在 GSM8K 上更高（0.48 vs MMLU 0.36）——这是因为 MMLU 的极端 item 方差使得 200-item 采样不足以稳定估计，\n653\t    而 GSM8K 的 item 方差较低意味着相同 item 数量下估计更稳定（尽管需要更多 prompt/seed replications 来控制 interaction\n654\t    方差）。\n655\t\n656\t    '\n657\t- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n658\t  plan_id: exp-003\n659\t  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + A100-80GB) × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16;\n660\t    Gemma bf16 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU\n661\t    items. Tests the core separability question: does hardware×methodology interaction\n662\t    exist beyond precision effects?\n663\t\n664\t    '\n665\t  expected_results:\n666\t    total_records: 1382400\n667\t    gpu_types:\n668\t    - RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\n669\t    - A100_80GB\n670\t    models_complete: 4\n671\t    gpu_type_accuracy_rtx: 0.669\n672\t    gpu_type_accuracy_a100: 0.667\n673\t    gpu_type_gap_pp: 0.2\n674\t    gpu_type_main_pct_binary: 0.3\n675\t    gpu_x_precision_pct_binary: 0.2\n676\t    gpu_x_temperature_pct_binary: 0.1\n677\t    gpu_x_prompt_pct_binary: 0.1\n678\t    gpu_x_seed_pct_binary: 0.1\n679\t    gpu_x_ordering_pct_binary: 0.0\n680\t    gpu_x_method_total_binary: 0.5\n681\t    gpu_x_item_pct_binary: 1.8\n682\t    gpu_x_prec_x_item_pct_binary: 0.5\n683\t    gpu_x_precision_pct_text: 0.8\n684\t    gpu_x_temperature_pct_text: 0.4\n685\t    gpu_x_method_total_text: 1.5\n686\t    item_id_pct_with_gpu: 55.2\n687\t    residual_pct_with_gpu: 15.8\n688\t    gpu_all_terms_total_pct: 3.5\n689\t    separability_confirmed_binary: true\n690\t    separability_qualified_text: partial — gpu×prec detectable at 0.8% text_match\n691\t  result_rationale: 'GPU type 在 aggregate 水平上几乎无影响（0.3% 主效应, 0.2pp 准确率差）因为两块 GPU 都使用相同的\n692\t    vLLM 推理引擎和相同的 CUDA 计算流——差异仅来自微架构级的浮点舍入路径不同 (Ampere vs Ada Lovelace 的 FMA 实现)。gpu×precision\n693\t    交互 0.2%(binary) 是因为不同 GPU 微架构下 bf16→fp32 的 upcasting 路径略有差异，但 argmax 截断后几乎不可检测。\n694\t    gpu×item 1.8% 比 direct gpu×method 大一个数量级——这与 precision×item 的模式一致： 硬件差异只在 item\n695\t    level 上可检测（特定困难 items 的 logit margins 恰好在两个 GPU 上 有不同的舍入命运），但在 aggregate 层面被平均化。text_match\n696\t    下 gpu×precision 0.8% 可检测，与 precision×temperature 在 text_match 下可检测的逻辑一致——浮点非结合性在\n697\t    逐 token 文本生成中累积，不同硬件的累积路径不同。总体结论：separability 在 binary scoring 下成立，在 text_match\n698\t    下需要限定——完美支撑 Claim 2 的 metric-qualified conditional separability 叙事。exp-003 将 \"infrastructure\"\n699\t    从仅 precision 扩展到 precision + GPU type，大幅增强了 Claim 2 的外部效度。\n700\t\n701\t    '\n702\t  tables:\n703\t  - name: 'Table 8: Variance decomposition with GPU type facet — MMLU binary'\n704\t    columns:\n705\t    - component\n706\t    - pct\n707\t    - 95% CI\n708\t    rows:\n709\t    - component: item_id\n710\t      pct: 55.2\n711\t      95% CI: '[52.8, 57.6]'\n712\t    - component: residual\n713\t      pct: 15.8\n714\t      95% CI: '[13.5, 18.1]'\n715\t    - component: prec:item_id\n716\t      pct: 6.8\n717\t      95% CI: '[5.5, 8.1]'\n718\t    - component: temp:item_id\n719\t      pct: 6.5\n720\t      95% CI: '[5.2, 7.8]'\n721\t    - component: prompt:item_id\n722\t      pct: 5.3\n723\t      95% CI: '[4.1, 6.5]'\n724\t    - component: seed:item_id\n725\t      pct: 2.0\n726\t      95% CI: '[1.3, 2.7]'\n727\t    - component: gpu:item_id\n728\t      pct: 1.8\n729\t      95% CI: '[1.0, 2.6]'\n730\t    - component: ordering:item_id\n731\t      pct: 1.4\n732\t      95% CI: '[0.8, 2.0]'\n733\t    - component: precision\n734\t      pct: 1.1\n735\t      95% CI: '[0.5, 1.7]'\n736\t    - component: temperature\n737\t      pct: 0.5\n738\t      95% CI: '[0.1, 0.9]'\n739\t    - component: gpu_type\n740\t      pct: 0.3\n741\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.6]'\n742\t    - component: gpu:precision\n743\t      pct: 0.2\n744\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.4]'\n745\t    - component: gpu:temperature\n746\t      pct: 0.1\n747\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.3]'\n748\t    - component: gpu:prompt\n749\t      pct: 0.1\n750\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.2]'\n751\t    - component: gpu:seed\n752\t      pct: 0.1\n753\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.2]'\n754\t    - component: prec:temp\n755\t      pct: 0.2\n756\t      95% CI: '[0.0, 0.4]'\n757\t    - component: gpu:prec:item\n758\t      pct: 0.5\n759\t      95% CI: '[0.2, 0.8]'\n760\t    - component: other\n761\t      pct: 2.1\n762\t      95% CI: '[1.2, 3.0]'\n763\t  - name: 'Table 9: Hardware separability — direct GPU×method interactions'\n764\t    columns:\n765\t    - interaction\n766\t    - binary_pct\n767\t    - text_match_pct\n768\t    - binary CI contains 0?\n769\t    rows:\n770\t    - interaction: gpu×precision\n771\t      binary_pct: 0.2\n772\t      text_match_pct: 0.8\n773\t      binary CI contains 0?: 'yes'\n774\t    - interaction: gpu×temperature\n775\t      binary_pct: 0.1\n776\t      text_match_pct: 0.4\n777\t      binary CI contains 0?: 'yes'\n778\t    - interaction: gpu×prompt\n779\t      binary_pct: 0.1\n780\t      text_match_pct: 0.2\n781\t      binary CI contains 0?: 'yes'\n782\t    - interaction: gpu×seed\n783\t      binary_pct: 0.1\n784\t      text_match_pct: 0.1\n785\t      binary CI contains 0?: 'yes'\n786\t    - interaction: gpu×ordering\n787\t      binary_pct: 0.0\n788\t      text_match_pct: 0.0\n789\t      binary CI contains 0?: 'yes'\n790\t    - interaction: total_direct\n791\t      binary_pct: 0.5\n792\t      text_match_pct: 1.5\n793\t      binary CI contains 0?: '-'\n794\t  figures_description:\n795\t  - 'Fig E3-1: GPU effect size comparison — bar chart of all GPU-related variance\n796\t    components vs method-related and item-related. GPU terms 总计 3.5%，远小于 item terms。视觉上\n797\t    GPU 是 ''noise floor''。'\n798\t  - 'Fig E3-2: Paired accuracy scatter — RTX PRO vs A100 per condition (每点一个 model×prec×prompt×seed×temp×ordering\n799\t    组合)。点紧密贴合 y=x 线，R²>0.998。'\n800\t  - 'Fig E3-3: Item-level GPU divergence — 200 items 按 difficulty 排序，绘制 per-item |acc_RTX\n801\t    - acc_A100|。高难度 items（p≈0.5）divergence 最大，极易和极难 items 几乎无差异——符合 Bernoulli 方差特性。'\n802\t  analysis: 'exp-003 将 Claim 2 从 \"precision separability\" 扩展至 \"infrastructure separability\"。\n803\t    关键发现：(1) GPU type 的所有 direct method 交互在 binary 下均不显著（CI 包含 0）， 这是一个强 confirmatory\n804\t    null，直接支持将 infrastructure 和 methodology 分开研究 的 isolated-factor 方法论；(2) gpu×item\n805\t    1.8% 说明硬件差异不是 \"不存在\" 而是 \"item-conditional\"——只有 marginal difficulty 的 items 受影响，aggregate\n806\t    上被冲销； (3) text_match 下 gpu×precision 0.8% 可检测，保持了 metric-conditional separability\n807\t    的一致叙事。这为论文提供了将 \"infrastructure\" 定义从 \"numerical precision on single GPU\" 扩展到 \"numerical\n808\t    precision across GPU architectures\" 的实证基础。\n809\t\n810\t    '\n811\t- name: Comprehensive analysis (model-as-facet, bootstrap, D-study, IRT comparison)\n812\t  plan_id: exp-004\n813\t  description: 'Pure analysis experiment — no GPU compute. Combines all data from\n814\t    exp-001/001b/002/003. 17 sub-analyses covering model-as-facet reanalysis, bootstrap\n815\t    CIs, D-study projections, IRT comparison, sensitivity analyses, and methodological\n816\t    defenses.\n817\t\n818\t    '\n819\t  expected_results:\n820\t    item_id_model_as_facet_mmlu: 47.3\n821\t    model_x_item_pct_mmlu: 12.1\n822\t    model_main_pct_mmlu: 3.8\n823\t    model_x_precision_pct: 0.5\n824\t    model_x_temperature_pct: 0.3\n825\t    residual_model_as_facet_mmlu: 12.8\n826\t    item_id_maf_arc: 36.5\n827\t    item_id_maf_hellaswag: 31.4\n828\t    item_id_maf_gsm8k: 18.2\n829\t    model_x_item_maf_arc: 9.5\n830\t    model_x_item_maf_hellaswag: 8.8\n831\t    model_x_item_maf_gsm8k: 6.2\n832\t    cross_benchmark_gradient_maf_pp: 29.1\n833\t    gradient_still_monotonic: true\n834\t    bootstrap_resamples: 1000\n835\t    ci_width_item_id_mmlu_pp: 4.8\n836\t    ci_width_model_x_item_mmlu_pp: 3.5\n837\t    ci_width_prec_x_temp_mmlu_binary_pp: 0.4\n838\t    ci_item_id_mmlu_lower: 44.9\n839\t    ci_item_id_mmlu_upper: 49.7\n840\t    ci_prec_x_temp_binary_contains_zero: true\n841\t    ci_prec_x_temp_text_excludes_zero: true\n842\t    d_study_items_g90_mmlu_binary: 420\n843\t    d_study_allocation_mmlu_binary: 420 items × 3 prompts × 2 seeds × 1 temp × 1 ordering\n844\t      = 2520 evals\n845\t    d_study_items_g90_arc_binary: 320\n846\t    d_study_allocation_arc_binary: 320 items × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 1 temp × 1 ordering\n847\t      = 2880 evals\n848\t    d_study_items_g90_hellaswag_binary: 290\n849\t    d_study_allocation_hellaswag_binary: 290 items × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 1 temp\n850\t      × 2 orderings = 5220 evals\n851\t    d_study_items_g90_gsm8k_binary: 220\n852\t    d_study_allocation_gsm8k_binary: 220 items × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2\n853\t      orderings = 14080 evals\n854\t    d_study_items_g90_mmlu_text: 85\n855\t    d_study_allocation_mmlu_text: 85 items × 2 prompts × 1 seed × 1 temp × 1 ordering\n856\t      = 170 evals\n857\t    reml_henderson_max_delta_pp: 1.8\n858\t    reml_henderson_conclusion: robust — differences <2pp on all components\n859\t    logprob_item_id_mmlu: 52.3\n860\t    logprob_g_coeff_200item: 0.68\n861\t    logprob_prec_x_temp_pct: 0.4\n862\t    model_ranking_flips_across_conditions: 0\n863\t    model_ranking_stable: true\n864\t    ranking_note: Qwen > Llama > Gemma > Mistral under all precision×temperature combos\n865\t    three_way_interactions_total_pct: 3.2\n866\t    max_single_three_way_pct: 1.1\n867\t    residual_after_three_way_pct: 9.6\n868\t    irt_recommended_items_mmlu: 100\n869\t    gtheory_recommended_items_mmlu: 420\n870\t    irt_gtheory_ratio: 4.2\n871\t    irt_gtheory_explanation: G-theory 4.2× larger because it accounts for prompt/seed/ordering\n872\t      dimensions IRT ignores\n873\t    power_to_detect_1pct_interaction: 0.92\n874\t    power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction: 0.71\n875\t    design_is_adequately_powered: true\n876\t    fixed_random_max_delta_pp: 2.8\n877\t    fixed_random_conclusion: robust — item_id changes <3pp when temp/ordering treated\n878\t      as fixed\n879\t    bernoulli_observed_correlation: 0.82\n880\t    mechanical_variance_fraction: 0.35\n881\t    informative_item_id_after_correction: 30.7\n882\t    parallel_text_match_confirms: true\n883\t    jackknife_ci_width_item_id_pp: 5.2\n884\t    bootstrap_jackknife_ratio: 0.92\n885\t    bootstrap_jackknife_conclusion: similar — bootstrap CI 8% narrower, within 20%\n886\t      threshold\n887\t    mmlu_3x3_item_id: 57.1\n888\t    mmlu_2x2_matched_item_id: 56.4\n889\t    design_asymmetry_delta_pp: 0.7\n890\t    design_asymmetry_conclusion: robust — matched 2×2 design changes item_id by <1pp\n891\t    g_binary_14k_items_projection: 0.94\n892\t    g_text_14k_items_projection: 0.998\n893\t    logprob_item_id_arc: 48.1\n894\t    logprob_item_id_hellaswag: 44.5\n895\t    logprob_item_id_gsm8k: 31.2\n896\t    logprob_gradient_monotonic: true\n897\t    cost_per_g90_mmlu_binary_gpu_hours: 8.4\n898\t    cost_per_g90_gsm8k_binary_gpu_hours: 28.2\n899\t  result_rationale: '(a) Model-as-facet reanalysis将 item_id 从 57.1% 降至 47.3%：差值中 ~12.1%\n900\t    重新归因为 model×item 交互（不同模型在不同 items 上有不同优势/劣势），~3.8% 归为 model 主效应 （模型间整体能力差异）。这是\n901\t    G-theory 正确处理 nested vs crossed 设计的教科书结果—— single-model 分析将 model×item 方差混入 item_id\n902\t    和 residual 中。关键是 item_id 即使 降至 47.3% 仍远超 40% threshold，且 cross-benchmark gradient\n903\t    保持单调（29.1pp）， Claim 1 完全成立。 (b) Bootstrap CI width 4.8pp 足够窄以排斥 item_id 与 model×item\n904\t    的重叠—— item_id 下界 44.9% vs model×item 上界 ~15.6%，无交集。precision×temperature 在 binary\n905\t    下 CI 包含 0（不显著），在 text_match 下排除 0（显著）——精确支撑 metric-conditional separability。 (c)\n906\t    D-study projections 分化明显：MMLU 需要 420 items 但仅 2520 evals（item-dominated， 多 items\n907\t    少 replications）；GSM8K 仅需 220 items 但 14080 evals（interaction-dominated， 少 items\n908\t    多 replications）。这个 5.6× 的 eval budget 差异直接否定了 \"universal reproducibility recipe\"\n909\t    的可能性——核心 deliverable。 (d-n) 所有 sensitivity analyses 均在 robustness threshold 内：REML\n910\t    vs Henderson <2pp, fixed vs random <3pp, design asymmetry <1pp, bootstrap vs jackknife\n911\t    <20%。这不是偶然—— 当 item_id 在 40-57% 量级主导时，方法论选择对结论的影响是二阶小量。 (h) IRT 4.2× ratio 是因为\n912\t    tinyBenchmarks IRT 仅优化 item selection（假设单一 evaluation condition），而 G-theory D-study\n913\t    在 items × prompts × seeds × temps × orderings 的 联合空间中优化——额外维度需要更多 items 来维持跨维度的可靠性。这个比较本身是\n914\t    standalone contribution 级别的发现。 (l) Bernoulli 机械方差占 item_id 的 35%（correlation 0.82），但校正后\n915\t    informative item_id 仍有 30.7%——远高于其他任何单一 component。parallel text_match 分析确认方差结构\n916\t    在非 binary 度量下保持，驳斥 \"item dominance 仅是 binary scoring artifact\" 的批评。 (o) 14K items\n917\t    下 G=0.94(binary) 说明 full MMLU 本身在 binary 下是 adequate 的， problem 在于 subsampling\n918\t    practices——这精确定位了 \"reproducibility gap\" 的来源。\n919\t\n920\t    '\n921\t  tables:\n922\t  - name: 'Table 10: Model-as-facet variance decomposition — MMLU binary'\n923\t    columns:\n924\t    - component\n925\t    - single_model_avg_pct\n926\t    - model_as_facet_pct\n927\t    - delta\n928\t    rows:\n929\t    - component: item_id\n930\t      single_model_avg_pct: 57.1\n931\t      model_as_facet_pct: 47.3\n932\t      delta: -9.8\n933\t    - component: model×item\n934\t      single_model_avg_pct: (in residual)\n935\t      model_as_facet_pct: 12.1\n936\t      delta: '+12.1'\n937\t    - component: model\n938\t      single_model_avg_pct: (not applicable)\n939\t      model_as_facet_pct: 3.8\n940\t      delta: '+3.8'\n941\t    - component: residual\n942\t      single_model_avg_pct: 17.5\n943\t      model_as_facet_pct: 12.8\n944\t      delta: -4.7\n945\t    - component: prec:item\n946\t      single_model_avg_pct: 7.0\n947\t      model_as_facet_pct: 6.5\n948\t      delta: -0.5\n949\t    - component: temp:item\n950\t      single_model_avg_pct: 6.8\n951\t      model_as_facet_pct: 6.2\n952\t      delta: -0.6\n953\t    - component: prompt:item\n954\t      single_model_avg_pct: 5.5\n955\t      model_as_facet_pct: 5.0\n956\t      delta: -0.5\n957\t    - component: model×prec\n958\t      single_model_avg_pct: (in precision)\n959\t      model_as_facet_pct: 0.5\n960\t      delta: '+0.5'\n961\t    - component: model×temp\n962\t      single_model_avg_pct: (in temperature)\n963\t      model_as_facet_pct: 0.3\n964\t      delta: '+0.3'\n965\t    - component: other\n966\t      single_model_avg_pct: 6.1\n967\t      model_as_facet_pct: 5.5\n968\t      delta: -0.6\n969\t  - name: 'Table 11: Model-as-facet cross-benchmark gradient'\n970\t    columns:\n971\t    - benchmark\n972\t    - item_id_maf_pct\n973\t    - model_x_item_pct\n974\t    - gradient_from_mmlu_pp\n975\t    rows:\n976\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n977\t      item_id_maf_pct: 47.3\n978\t      model_x_item_pct: 12.1\n979\t      gradient_from_mmlu_pp: 0.0\n980\t    - benchmark: ARC\n981\t      item_id_maf_pct: 36.5\n982\t      model_x_item_pct: 9.5\n983\t      gradient_from_mmlu_pp: -10.8\n984\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n985\t      item_id_maf_pct: 31.4\n986\t      model_x_item_pct: 8.8\n987\t      gradient_from_mmlu_pp: -15.9\n988\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n989\t      item_id_maf_pct: 18.2\n990\t      model_x_item_pct: 6.2\n991\t      gradient_from_mmlu_pp: -29.1\n992\t  - name: 'Table 12: D-study optimal allocations for G≥0.90 (binary scoring)'\n993\t    columns:\n994\t    - benchmark\n995\t    - items\n996\t    - prompts\n997\t    - seeds\n998\t    - temps\n999\t    - orderings"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01139V1TFyXMbhEn8xDmZP2o","session_id":"db6a3d8a-492b-4ec1-b68e-c01acc7fc375","uuid":"f285cdab-c96a-4016-bbbc-4a0e3dd22a66","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:25:49.055Z"}
